    "section": "Ordering Schematic"
  },
  "note": "Extracted by hand from the two page ordering schematic of the 0621 revision, with the folder's 0620 revision read alongside. The head runs model, then the LL column, dash size dash body material dash gauge port, the last left blank if not needed. The 0620 revision defines LL as the lift lever, prints trim finishes C and D as the 20Ra LL and 8Ra LL rows, and prints a lift lever actuator row marked 95LL only; the 0621 keeps the LL column and the footnote that trim option C/D requires actuator option LL but drops all three definitions, so the C and D finishes and the LL coupling are carried from the earlier printing and held for John. The trim ladder's inch brackets are enforced, with the DN twins matched as an inferred coupling. The o-ring tables split at Cv 3.0 by their own headings. The options non-standard row prints ZZ though the position is single width, carried as printed.",
